# ============================================================
# BUSINESS CARD API - FINAL TESTS
# Run the requests from top to bottom.
#
# Notes:
# 1. Start the server before running the tests.
# 2. The first registration requests create test users.
# 3. Admin must already exist in the database (Initial Data requirement).
# 4. Request names are used to reuse IDs/tokens from responses.
