# 13. FINAL MANUAL CHECKS - REQUIREMENTS
# ============================================================
#
# These are not all HTTP requests:
#
# [ ] MongoDB + Mongoose
# [ ] Express
# [ ] bcryptjs requirement / password hashing
# [ ] Joi validation
# [ ] jsonwebtoken
# [ ] config
# [ ] Morgan
# [ ] CORS - authorized origins only
# [ ] Chalk console output
# [ ] JSON request body
# [ ] public folder fallback + 404
# [ ] Local environment
# [ ] Atlas environment
# [ ] Initial data: 3 users (regular/business/admin)
# [ ] Initial data: 3 cards
# [ ] README.md
# [ ] No node_modules in submitted Git repository
# [ ] No file over 200 lines
# [ ] Clean code / meaningful names / no unnecessary console.log
#
# BONUS - only if desired:
# [ ] Admin can change unique bizNumber
# [ ] Error file logger for 400+
# [ ] Google API auth
# [ ] Block login after 3 consecutive wrong passwords for 24h


